{"id":"0c50226ab37e9ce8","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-recursion-hierarchy.md","title":"Arithmetical Recursion Hierarchy Formula","display":"df-recursion-hierarchy — Arithmetical Recursion Hierarchy Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-recursion-hierarchy","aliases":["62-df-recursion-hierarchy"],"display":"df-recursion-hierarchy — Arithmetical Recursion Hierarchy Formula","depends_on":["[[62-df-linear-order]]","[[62-df-coded-function]]","[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions I.11.1, V.2.2","source_pages":[39,174],"source_pdf_pages":[57,192]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-recursion-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-recursion-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursion-hierarchy — Arithmetical Recursion Hierarchy Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ecc1f15e98d07497\" href=\"?note=ecc1f15e98d07497\" title=\"62-df-linear-order\">62-df-linear-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions I.11.1, V.2.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>39</span><span>174</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57</span><span>192</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>序、编码和句法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ecc1f15e98d07497\" href=\"?note=ecc1f15e98d07497\" title=\"62-df-linear-order\">62-df-linear-order</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(n,a,Z,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\">\\(\\theta(n,a,Z,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,R,H\">\\(W,R,H\\)</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 中自由出现。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 是待替换的集合变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,a\">\\(n,a\\)</span> 是不同的数变量，均不同于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar u\">\\(\\bar u\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z,H,W,R\">\\(Z,H,W,R\\)</span> 是不同的集合变量，均不同于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar A\">\\(\\bar A\\)</span>。这些要求只限制语法变量名，不限制其赋值相等。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var},\\operatorname{Ren},\\nu_y\">\\(\\operatorname{Var},\\operatorname{Ren},\\nu_y\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a> 中的带类型语法递归。下述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}\">\\(\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}\\)</span> 以有限公式树为域。</p>\n<p>在模板方程中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(t),b(t),k(y,\\varphi)\">\\(m(t),b(t),k(y,\\varphi)\\)</span> 的值是语法变量符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists m(t)\">\\(\\exists m(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists b(t)\">\\(\\exists b(t)\\)</span> 因而是对所选变量的语法量词构造，不是对函数值作对象量化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>。数值配对及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_R\">\\(\\prec_R\\)</span> 在公式模板中按各自的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span> 定义展开。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar u\\in V_N^*\">\\(\\bar u\\in V_N^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar A\\in V_S^*\">\\(\\bar A\\in V_S^*\\)</span> 为元语法参数列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_1(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{n,a\\}\\cup\\{u_i:i&lt;|\\bar u|\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_1(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{n,a\\}\\cup\\{u_i:i&lt;|\\bar u|\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{Z\\}\\cup\\{A_i:i&lt;|\\bar A|\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{Z\\}\\cup\\{A_i:i&lt;|\\bar A|\\}\\)</span>。因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf H_\\theta\">\\(\\mathsf H_\\theta\\)</span> 的显示实参覆盖全部自由参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\;H^{&lt;a}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle m,b\\rangle_N:b\\in W,\\ b\\prec_R a,\\ \\langle m,b\\rangle_N\\in H\\},\\qquad H_a\\coloneqq(H)_a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\;H^{&lt;a}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle m,b\\rangle_N:b\\in W,\\ b\\prec_R a,\\ \\langle m,b\\rangle_N\\in H\\},\\qquad H_a\\coloneqq(H)_a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta^{H,W,R,a}\\coloneqq\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta^{H,W,R,a}\\coloneqq\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf H_\\theta(W,R,H;\\bar u,\\bar A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{LO}(W,R)\\land H\\subseteq N\\times_N W\\land\n\\forall a\\in W\\forall n\\;(\\langle n,a\\rangle_N\\in H\\leftrightarrow\\theta^{H,W,R,a}(n,a,\\bar u,\\bar A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf H_\\theta(W,R,H;\\bar u,\\bar A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{LO}(W,R)\\land H\\subseteq N\\times_N W\\land\n\\forall a\\in W\\forall n\\;(\\langle n,a\\rangle_N\\in H\\leftrightarrow\\theta^{H,W,R,a}(n,a,\\bar u,\\bar A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nB&amp;\\coloneqq\\{H,W,R,a\\},\\\\\nm(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\nu_{n_0}(\\operatorname{Var}(t)\\cup B\\cup\\{Z\\}),\\\\\nb(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\nu_{n_0}(\\operatorname{Var}(t)\\cup B\\cup\\{Z,m(t)\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf P(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists m(t)\\le t\\,\\exists b(t)\\le t\\,\n\\bigl(t=\\langle m(t),b(t)\\rangle_N\\land b(t)\\in W\\land b(t)\\prec_R a\\land\\langle m(t),b(t)\\rangle_N\\in H\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(s=t)&amp;\\coloneqq(s=t),\\quad\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(s&lt;t)\\coloneqq(s&lt;t),\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(t\\in Y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathsf P(t)&amp;Y=Z,\\\\t\\in Y&amp;Y\\ne Z,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\varphi)\\circ\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\psi),\\\\\nk(y,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\nu_y(\\operatorname{Var}(\\varphi)\\cup B\\cup\\{y,Z\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(Qy\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nQy\\varphi&amp;y=Z\\lor Z\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi),\\\\\nQy\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\varphi)&amp;y\\ne Z\\land Z\\in\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi)\\land y\\notin B,\\\\\nQz\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(\\varphi))\n&amp;y\\ne Z\\land Z\\in\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi)\\land y\\in B,\\quad z=k(y,\\varphi).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nB&amp;\\coloneqq\\{H,W,R,a\\},\\\\\nm(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\nu_{n_0}(\\operatorname{Var}(t)\\cup B\\cup\\{Z\\}),\\\\\nb(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\nu_{n_0}(\\operatorname{Var}(t)\\cup B\\cup\\{Z,m(t)\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf P(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists m(t)\\le t\\,\\exists b(t)\\le t\\,\n\\bigl(t=\\langle m(t),b(t)\\rangle_N\\land b(t)\\in W\\land b(t)\\prec_R a\\land\\langle m(t),b(t)\\rangle_N\\in H\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(s=t)&amp;\\coloneqq(s=t),\\quad\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(s&lt;t)\\coloneqq(s&lt;t),\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(t\\in Y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathsf P(t)&amp;Y=Z,\\\\t\\in Y&amp;Y\\ne Z,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\varphi)\\circ\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\psi),\\\\\nk(y,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\nu_y(\\operatorname{Var}(\\varphi)\\cup B\\cup\\{y,Z\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(Qy\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nQy\\varphi&amp;y=Z\\lor Z\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi),\\\\\nQy\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\varphi)&amp;y\\ne Z\\land Z\\in\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi)\\land y\\notin B,\\\\\nQz\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(\\varphi))\n&amp;y\\ne Z\\land Z\\in\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi)\\land y\\in B,\\quad z=k(y,\\varphi).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 的自由成员原子。展开式仍是算术公式；没有把集合代码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^{&lt;a}\">\\(H^{&lt;a}\\)</span> 当作数值项，也没有引入一个未定义的算子。前驱编码和截面由有界理解存在。按书中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n,a)\">\\((n,a)\\)</span> 排序；允许显式阶段参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 是 V.5.1 等处使用的形式。省略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 时得到 I.11.1 的版本。本公式仅判定一个已给出的 H 是否为递归结果，不预先假定 H 存在。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definitions I.11.1, V.2.2；纸面页 39, 174；PDF 页 57, 192。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"ecc1f15e98d07497","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8535a715d3193fba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"ecc1f15e98d07497","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"序、编码和句法见 [[62-df-linear-order]]、[[62-df-coded-function]]、[[62-df-L2]]。$\\theta(n,a,Z,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；$W,R,H$ 不在 $\\theta$ 中自由出现。$Z$ 是待替换的集合变量。$n,a$ 是不同的数变量