","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"序、编码和句法见 [[62-df-linear-order]]、[[62-df-coded-function]]、[[62-df-L2]]。$\\theta(n,a,Z,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；$W,R,H$ 不在 $\\theta$ 中自由出现。$Z$ 是待替换的集合变量。$n,a$ 是不同的数变量，均不同于 $\\bar u$；$Z,H,W,R$ 是不同的集合变量，均不同于 $\\bar A$。这些要求只限制语法变量名，不限制其赋值相等。$\\operatorname{Var},\\operatorname{Ren},\\nu_y$ 采用 [[62-df-L2]] 中的带类型语法递归。下述 $\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}$ 以有限公式树为域。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta(n,a,Z,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)","display":false},{"tex":"W,R,H","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"n,a","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar u","display":false},{"tex":"Z,H,W,R","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var},\\operatorname{Ren},\\nu_y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}","display":false},{"tex":"m(t),b(t),k(y,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists m(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists b(t)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_R","display":false},{"tex":"L_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar u\\in V_N^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar A\\in V_S^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_1(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{n,a\\}\\cup\\{u_i:i<|\\bar u|\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{Z\\}\\cup\\{A_i:i<|\\bar A|\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf H_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\;H^{<a}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle m,b\\rangle_N:b\\in W,\\ b\\prec_R a,\\ \\langle m,b\\rangle_N\\in H\\},\\qquad H_a\\coloneqq(H)_a.","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta^{H,W,R,a}\\coloneqq\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\theta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf H_\\theta(W,R,H;\\bar u,\\bar A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{LO}(W,R)\\land H\\subseteq N\\times_N W\\land\n\\forall a\\in W\\forall n\\;(\\langle n,a\\rangle_N\\in H\\leftrightarrow\\theta^{H,W,R,a}(n,a,\\bar u,\\bar A)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nB&\\coloneqq\\{H,W,R,a\\},\\\\\nm(t)&\\coloneqq\\nu_{n_0}(\\operatorname{Var}(t)\\cup B\\cup\\{Z\\}),\\\\\nb(t)&\\coloneqq\\nu_{n_0}(\\operatorname{Var}(t)\\cup B\\cup\\{Z,m(t)\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf P(t)&\\coloneqq\\exists m(t)\\le t\\,\\exists b(t)\\le t\\,\n\\bigl(t=\\langle m(t),b(t)\\rangle_N\\land b(t)\\in W\\land b(t)\\prec_R a\\land\\langle m(t),b(t)\\rangle_N\\in H\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(s=t)&\\coloneqq(s=t),\\quad\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(s<t)\\coloneqq(s<t),\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(t\\in Y)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathsf P(t)&Y=Z,\\\\t\\in Y&Y\\ne Z,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\neg\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\varphi)\\circ\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\psi),\\\\\nk(y,\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\nu_y(\\operatorname{Var}(\\varphi)\\cup B\\cup\\{y,Z\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(Qy\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nQy\\varphi&y=Z\\lor Z\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi),\\\\\nQy\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\varphi)&y\\ne Z\\land Z\\in\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi)\\land y\\notin B,\\\\\nQz\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{y,z}(\\varphi))\n&y\\ne Z\\land Z\\in\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi)\\land y\\in B,\\quad z=k(y,\\varphi).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"H^{<a}","display":false},{"tex":"(n,a)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false}],"bytes":3957,"backlinks":[{"id":"23442ad478f1b29e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf H_\\theta$ 见 [[62-df-recursion-hierarchy]]，$\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)$ 见 [[62-df-WellOrder]]，$\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；UC 见 [[62-df-L2]]。所有新变量都满足递归层级定义中的新鲜条件。"},{"id":"0db76c21ee915f76","anchor":"ref-9","locat